    "description": "Takara Standard Co.,Ltd. manufactures and sells housing equipment and fixtures in Japan. It offers kitchen products, including enamel, wooden, and compact kitchen systems; enamel kitchen panels, heating equipment, and range hoods; bathroom products comprising bath system, shower units, and standalone bathtubs. The company also provides bathroom vanity products, such as enamel vanity, wooden vanity, compact hand wash, enamel clean wash panels, residential toilet panels, enamel clean toilet panels, hand washing basins, and various storage devices. In addition, it is involved in other products that include ecocute, oil and gas water heaters, enamel wall coverings, frits, thin enamel plates, and other residential equipment. Further, the company offers real estate leasing; and kitchen sets. The company was formerly known as Nippon Enamel Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Takara Standard Co.,Ltd. in 1971. Takara Standard Co.,Ltd. was incorporated in 1912 and is headquartered in Osaka, Japan."
